  <ifrs:ExplanationOfAccountingPoliciesAndMethodsOfComputationFollowedInInterimFinancialStatements contextRef="TrimestreAcumuladoActual">Las politicas contables son reveladas en el formato XBRL [800600] Notas - Lista de políticas contables.</ifrs:ExplanationOfAccountingPoliciesAndMethodsOfComputationFollowedInInterimFinancialStatements>
  <ifrs:ExplanationOfAdjustmentsThatWouldBeNecessaryToAchieveFairPresentation contextRef="TrimestreAcumuladoActual">NA</ifrs:ExplanationOfAdjustmentsThatWouldBeNecessaryToAchieveFairPresentation>
